ETL Madness go-flowAPI is the centralized REST API, database artifact
repository, live Server-Sent Events (SSE) execution gateway, granular
pipeline ACL engine, and multi-database telemetry service for the Flow
Ecosystem.

Installed isolated under /opt/flow-api with OpenBSD rc.d(8) service
integration (/etc/rc.d/go_flow_api) and environment configuration at
/etc/go-flow-api/go-flow-api.env.

To enable and start the daemon via rcctl(8) after configuring
FLOW_API_DSN in /etc/go-flow-api/go-flow-api.env:

    doas rcctl enable go_flow_api
    doas rcctl start go_flow_api
